  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dbd6ee4ba19a0c644b9d86ffb56f4050, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_NYC_PictureFrame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - "T\xECnh ch\xFAng ta b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u khi m\xF9a thu tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i,
    khi nh\u1EEFng ch\xF9m hoa th\u1EA1ch th\u1EA3o ng\xE1t h\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xEAn
    nh\u1EEFng l\u1ED1i \u0111i quen."
  - "M\xF9a thu b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u tr\xEAn d\xF2ng s\xF4ng b\xE1t ng\xE1t, m\xF9a
    thu nhu\u1ED9m v\xE0ng nh\u1EEFng c\xE1nh r\u1EEBng, m\xF9a thu ph\u01A1i \xE1o
    m\u01A1 phai, chi\u1EC1u v\xF5 v\xE0ng v\u1EDBi x\xE1c hoa tr\xEAn m\xECnh b\u01B0\u1EDBm. "
  - "Anh \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1EDBi em nh\u01B0 \u0111\xE1m m\xE2y th\xE1ng
    B\u1EA3y tr\u0129u n\u1EB7ng m\u01B0a r\xE0o. Anh \u0111\xE3 t\u01B0\u1EDFng
    qu\xEAn, d\xF9 b\xE2y gi\u1EDD m\xF9a thu \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt."
  - "M\u1ED7i m\xF9a thu kh\xE1c c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1, nh\u01B0ng m\xF9a
    thu c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng ta \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt. Anh c\u0169ng \u0111\u1EEBng qu\xEAn
    c\xE1i ng\xE0y sung s\u01B0\u1EDBng h\u1EA1nh ph\xFAc \u0111\xF3. Anh \u0111\u1EEBng
    qu\xEAn em d\xF9 \u0111\xF4i ch\xFAng ta s\u1EBD ch\u1EB3ng c\xF2n tao ph\xF9ng
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\u1EEFa\u2026"
  lines_en:
  - Our love began when autumn returned, when clusters of asters filled the familiar
    paths with their fragrance.
  - Autumn began upon the vast and open river, autumn turned the forests golden,
    autumn spread faded dreams beneath the sun, while the evening grew wan, strewn
    with fallen flowers upon the wings of butterflies.
  - "You came to me like a July cloud, heavy with the promise of a sudden shower.
    I thought I had forgotten\u2014 though now, our autumn has died."
  - "Our love began when autumn returned, Other autumns may return, but our autumn
    is gone forever. And you, too, must never forget that beautiful day, that day
    of joy and happiness. Do not forget me, even though the two of us may never meet
    again\u2026"
